%% Accessibility description (full sentence form, required per DSF-001 §G row 3 / DSF-003 §9.8):
%% This diagram lists all twelve TradeValidationPipeline stages in exact order, since the diagram's
%% meaning depends entirely on order: AI / Strategy Engine, Trade Proposal, Signal Validator, Strategy
